@title Feature Flags: Build or Buy
@subtitle Decision page for the Growth team
@author Growth team, Pebble Bank

Today we keep 140 flags in a config file, and flipping one takes a 40-minute deploy.

kpi Flags today | 140 | in a config file
kpi Time to flip a flag | 40 min | full deploy | bad

## Comparison
table = Option,Annual cost,Setup time,Targeting rules,Audit log; LaunchDarkly,"$54,000",1 week,Advanced,Yes; Unleash (self-hosted),"$9,000 hosting",3 weeks,Good,Yes; In-house,No license cost,10 weeks,Basic,Would need building

## Recommendation
! **Choose Unleash.** It covers our targeting needs, and its audit log satisfies the compliance team, at a sixth of the cost of LaunchDarkly.

## Risks
- We own Unleash upgrades and uptime.
- None of the options has an SDK for our COBOL batch jobs.
